<<<
an infinitive. J look forward to meet, or to meeting, him? I aim to remove, or at removing, the cause? The duiy is laid on us to do, or of doing, our best?
===
an infinitive. *I look forward to meet,* or *to meeting, him? I aim to remove,* or *at removing, the cause? The duty is laid on us to do,* or *of doing, our best?*
>>>

<<<
in which the questicn arises
===
in which the question arises
