<<<
to the present tariff flatly conflicts with ... (of keeping. Determination). / The Government can in no circumstances neglect its elementary duty to protect the worker (of protecting. Obligation)./They have been selected
===
*to the present tariff flatly conflicts with* . . . (of keeping. Determination)./*The Government can in no circumstances neglect its elementary* duty to protect *the worker* (of protecting. Obligation)./*They have been selected*
>>>

<<<
with a view to illustrate both the thought & action of the writers life (illustrating. Analogue for with a view, so as)./Then Humperdinck had the happy idea one day to write a little fairy opera (of writing. Inspiration)./Russia assures us that she has no
===
*with a* view to illustrate *both the thought & action of the writer’s life* (illustrating. Analogue for *with a view,* so as)./*Then Humperdinck had the happy* idea *one day* to write *a little fairy opera* (of writing. Inspiration)./*Russia assures us that she has no*
>>>

<<<
intention to encroach upon it (of encroaching. But idiom after intention is less fixed than after most such nouns)./You have likened the
===
intention to encroach *upon it* (of encroaching. But idiom after *intention* is less fixed than after most such nouns)./*You have likened the*
