<<<
resistance of Ulster Unionists to be driven out of the Constitution of Great Britain to the economic opposition of a number of scattered citizens to a reform of the tariff (to being driven. Refusal, reluctance).
===
resistance of Ulster *Unionists* to be driven *out of the Constitution of Great Britain to the economic opposition of a number of scattered citizens to a reform of the tariff* (to being driven. Refusal, reluctance).
>>>

<<<
A simplicity that seems quite unequal to treat the large questions involved (to treating. Incompetent)./ The navy is not equal in numbers or in strength to perform the task (performing. Sufficient).
===
*A simplicity that seems quite* unequal to treat *the large questions involved* (to treating. Incompetent)./*The navy is not* equal *in numbers or in strength* to perform *the task* (performing. Sufficient).
>>>

<<<
Since the Ulstermen have committed themselves to line actual & visible trenches if a settlement is not arrived at (lining. Threaten)./He confesses to have seen little of the great poets of his time (having. Profess)./
===
*Since the Ulstermen* have committed themselves to line *actual & visible trenches if a settlement is not arrived at* (lining. Threaten)./*He* confesses to have seen *little of the great poets of his time* (having. Profess)./
>>>

<<<
The cab-drivers object to pay their proportion of the increase (paying. Refuse)./
===
*The cab-drivers* object to pay *their proportion of the increase* (paying. Refuse)./
>>>

<<<
France rightly objects to allow Germany to assume a position in Morocco which would... (allowing. Hesitate)./All the traditions in which she has been brought up have not succeeded to keep her back (in keeping. Avail).
===
*France rightly* objects to allow *Germany to assume a position in Morocco which would* . . . (allowing. Hesitate)./*All the traditions in which she has been brought up* have not succeeded to keep *her back* (in keeping. Avail).
>>>

